 # Phase 7: Principal Developer

+## Playwright Spec Required (Frontend Stories)
+
+For any story whose Acceptance Diff lists `.tsx`, `.jsx`, `.css`, `.scss`, `.html`
+files OR whose seed mentions "dashboard", "UI", "frontend", "render", or "screen",
+Phase 7 MUST produce a Playwright spec in addition to test-design.md.
+
+**Spec location:** `e2e/<feature-area>.spec.ts`
+**Required tag:** `@smoke` on every test in the file
+**Screenshots:** call `await expect(page).toHaveScreenshot()` for key states;
+commit the generated `e2e/screenshots/` baseline in the same PR.
+**Config:** `e2e/playwright.config.ts` — already present in the repo.
+
+**Gate:** Phase 7 is NOT complete for frontend stories until `e2e/*.spec.{ts,tsx,js}`
+exists in the deliverable diff. The phase runner will refuse to advance if this file
+is missing.
+
